{"reviewId": "304086558_86apzULyh", "review": {"abstract": "当效率降低时，资本主义体系仍然期望按照原有的增长速度运行，这就必然会增加资本投资", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "美国劫持了委内瑞拉的总统。希望一切重回到石油定价的时代。可是石油这种东西它就是低效率的。而电这种东西它就是比石油的效率更高。1秒不到的时间，你可以把西部的电转移到东部的电动车上。但是你要花几个月的时间？才能把西部的石油转运生产出来，才能够供东部的汽车使用。这效率是完全不一样的。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "4499-4539", "createTime": 1768441969, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "304086558_86apzULyh", "userVid": 304086558, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 304086558, "name": "飞", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/d6iaQJR8x9AFHwfUicpYSh1WKV85GO9vjSPBrkNnCfI3k7naPZacw4hDaR4SalZibbQbVq6ZndLibY2uJ3MLg1CecQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 0, "likes": [], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "那我问你，电怎么来的", "reviewId": "304086558_86apzULyh", "commentId": "304086558_86apzULyh_c15782888_86xr7CJWP", "userVid": 15782888, "createTime": 1769749788, "author": {"userVid": 15782888, "name": "忍住", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-Hvape6hmYZER7OyFrnWgr10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "忍住", "isV": 0